      "widgets_values": [
        "SAM-Audio Models & Setup Guide\n\n1. Download SAM-Audio Model (Base or Large):\n   Repo: https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-SamAudio\n   Files:\n   - sam_audio_base.safetensors (1.73 GB - fast, daily driver)\n   - sam_audio_large.safetensors (6.38 GB - maximum separation fidelity)\n\n   Place in folder:\n   📂 ComfyUI/models/sam-audio/\n\n2. Download T5-Base Text Encoder:\n   File: t5-base.safetensors (892 MB)\n   Repo: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/t5-base/\n\n   Place in folder:\n   📂 ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/\n\n3. Tips:\n   - CFG = 1.0 (default)\n   - Set Steps = 16 or 32 with 'midpoint' method\n   - target_audio = isolated sound\n   - residual_audio = background / remainder"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "SAM-Audio Models & Setup Guide\n\n1. Download SAM-Audio Model (Base or Large):\n   Repo: https://huggingface.co/Aero-Ex/ComfyUI-SamAudio\n   Files:\n   - sam_audio_base.safetensors (1.73 GB - fast, daily driver)\n   - sam_audio_large.safetensors (6.38 GB - maximum separation fidelity)\n\n   Place in folder:\n   📂 ComfyUI/models/sam-audio/\n\n2. Download T5-Base Text Encoder:\n   File: t5-base.safetensors (892 MB)\n   Repo: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/t5-base/\n\n   Place in folder:\n   📂 ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/\n\n3. Tips:\n   - CFG = 1.0 (default)\n   - Set Steps = 16 or 32 with 'midpoint' method\n   - target_audio = isolated sound\n   - residual_audio = background / remainder"
      },
